# berr_fetch: bus-mode expectations, checked by hand: frame 1 PC $600 FA $600 (long fetch,
# SSW $0106), frame 2 PC $60e (the instruction) FA $610 (the long fetch holding the armed $612),
# frame 3 PC $64e FA $650 (the first of two faulting fetches the instruction needs; the second,
# $654, was fetched speculatively and is never raised); no frame for the $630 prefetch past the
# BRA at $62e (it shares a fetch pair with the BRA); WB3D = the previous write data
